#ASSERT `s 2021(c)(2) the action is subject to review as provided in section 2023` `s 2021(c)(2) the imposition of a civil penalty` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2021(c)(2) the action is subject to review as provided in section 2023` `s 2021(c)(2) some other action` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `tests -- s 2021(d)`

